# CLI Component

## Overview
The CLI component of the Korean Language Learner provides a command-line interface for translating English text to Korean and generating audio files of the translations.

## Main File
[hangul.py](mdc:hangul.py) - The main entry point for the CLI tool

## Features
- Translates English text to Korean using OpenAI's GPT-4o model
- Generates audio files using OpenAI's Text-to-Speech API
- Saves audio output as MP3 files in the `/audio_output` directory
- Accepts input interactively or as command-line arguments

## Usage
- Interactive Mode: `python hangul.py` or `make run`
- With Phrase Argument: `python hangul.py "Your phrase"` or `make runp phrase="Your phrase"`

## Dependencies
- OpenAI API for translation and audio generation
- Environment variables from [.env](mdc:.env) for API keys

## Integration
The CLI component is independent of the web application but shares common configuration settings and can be used alongside the web application.
